>As of Oct 12, February to March has come in under 90% of normal in 40 of 75 years since 1951 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids here, the most of any pair. In 2025 October to November ran 34% of normal on the middle. The 2026 numbers published so far run low on the middle, with January to February at 37% and April to May at 72%. Every grid had its driest year in 1954, and grid 23504 fell to 44% that year.</p>"}
